OL,3,GNEWSACommunity fitness event seeks
OL,4,Afunding to expand
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who founded a community-based
OL,7,Ffitness event said it had been so
OL,8,Fsuccessful that he is bidding for funds
OL,9,Fto extend it.
OL,11,FTim Howe, from Swindon in Wiltshire,
OL,12,Fstarted The Longevity Games (TLG) in
OL,13,F2024. It runs four times a year and
OL,14,Fincludes functional exercises for
OL,15,Fimproving everyday mobility.
OL,17,FThe latest games take place on Sunday
OL,18,Fat Swindon Harriers, with hundreds of
OL,19,Fparticipants expected to take part in
OL,20,Fthe free event.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
