OL,3,GNEWSACommunity fitness event seeks
OL,4,Afunding to expand
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We've applied for our first bit of
OL,7,Ffunding, and we're looking to go into
OL,8,Fsocially deprived areas and put on
OL,9,Fcommunity training groups run by PTs,
OL,10,Fwhich are free of charge," Howe said.
